<!--
  French translation.

  Only translatable strings are listed. Anything marked translatable="false" in
  values/strings.xml - the dummy_* layout placeholders, intent action names, N/A,
  the KAD counter format - is deliberately left to fall back to the base file.

  Format specifiers (%s, %1$s, %1$d, %2$s) are reproduced exactly, in the same
  order as the English source, since the arguments are positional.

  Note on apostrophes: aapt rejects a bare ' in a resource string, and French is
  full of them, so every one is escaped as \'.
-->
